person":{"lines":[{"key":"greeting:first","text":{"en":"Hello there. Where are you from? So many people have been passing through lately.","zh":"你好啊，从哪儿来的？这阵子过路的人真多。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"Those who come to pray these days ask for longer days and quiet nights. I tell them what the Church teaches: suffering brings us closer to God.","zh":"近来来祷告的人，求的多是白昼长些、夜里平安。我便照教会的教导告诉他们：苦难使人接近神。"}},{"key":"hour:morning","text":{"en":"Morning prayers are just over. If you want holy water, you will have to wait for the deacon; he has the key.","zh":"晨祷刚做完。你若要领圣水，得等执事回来，钥匙在他身上。"}},{"key":"default","text":{"en":"The wolves have been bold this year. They took three of our sheep last month, and we've raised the fence again.","zh":"今年的狼胆子大，上个月叼走了我们三只羊。篱笆我们又加高了一截。"}}]}}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0.s0.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0.s0.1","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/light/candle","id":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0.s0.2","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0"}},{"type":"item/vessel/flask/holy_water","id":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0.s1.0","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0.coin0","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0.coin1","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0.coin2","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0.coin3","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holder":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0"}},{"id":"redmarch.rustholm-shrine.folk0.coin4","type":"item/misc/thornmark","place":{"on":"inside","holde